### Update phone
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/user/phone
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "phone": "+79991234569"
}

### Update telegram chat id
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/user/telegram
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "telegram_chat_id": "@karina"
}